2. THE VALUES, each found in record l9stk's own text (fnd/l9stk at 2c8b29fb), and this record's SESSION choices
   P U101  LM5069MM-2       l9stk 15.4 C-1, 'an LM5069-2 circuit breaker on board P'
   P R101  4m 1%            l9stk 15.4 table, Sense RS: 4 mOhm and 7.5 mOhm in parallel, 1 %
   P R102  7.5m 1%          l9stk 15.4 table, Sense RS
   P Q101  CSD18510Q5B      l9stk 15.4 table, FETs: 2 x CSD18510Q5B
   P Q102  CSD18510Q5B      l9stk 15.4 table, FETs
   P R103  8.45k            l9stk 15.4 table, Power limit: RPWR 8.45 kOhm
   P C101  10n              l9stk 15.4 table, Fault timer: 10 nF
   P C102  22n              l9stk 15.4 table, dv/dt start: 22 nF
   P D101  SMCJ18A          l9stk 15.4 table, Clamps: SMCJ18A on VIN
   P R104  200k             l9stk 15.4 table, Controller: UVLO from VIN through R_U 200 kOhm
   P C103  3.3u 50V         l9stk 15.4 table, Controller: into C_U 3.3 uF (50 V)
   P R106  10k              l9stk 15.4 C-1b: the loop leaves board P from VIN through 10 kOhm
   P R107  22k              l9stk 15.4 C-1b: a 22 kOhm divider on a first 2N7002's gate
   P Q103  2N7002           l9stk 15.4 C-1b: a first 2N7002
   P Q104  2N7002           l9stk 15.4 C-1b: a second 2N7002
   P R105  150R             l9stk 15.4 C-1b: discharges UVLO through 150 ohm
   P R108  1M               l9stk l9stk_protection.py R_G (prot 3a): the second inverter's gate divider, each half
   P R109  1M               l9stk l9stk_protection.py R_G (prot 3a)
   A RT1   PRF15BB103RB6RC  l9stk 15.5 THE THERMAL GUARD: the kit's PRF15BB103 chip PTC, in the enable loop on the battery FETs' copper
   l9stk reads: IF-6
   l9stk reads: the controller row: OVLO to ground
   l9stk reads: condition C2: the ground between, in J_SMB and on the block
   l9stk reads: C-1b: two contacts 1 mm short (Layer 7's)
   l9stk reads: 15.5: the third battery FET's designator is L4-E11's
   l9stk reads: 15.5: the PTC on the battery FETs' copper (board A)
   l9stk_protection.py's constants agree with the page: R_E1 10 kOhm, R_E2 22 kOhm, R_DIS 150 ohm, R_U 200 kOhm; R_G 1 MOhm
   SESSION designators     the free 100 block on board P (U101, Q101 to Q104, D101, R101 to R109, C101 to C105, TP101 to TP104); RT1 on board A, which carries no RT designator
   SESSION net names       BRK_VIN (Q2's source, the breaker's input), BRK_SNS, BRK_GATE, BRK_TMR, BRK_PWR, BRK_UVLO, BRK_G2, BRK_DIS, BRK_CMID; DOCK_EN_OUT and DOCK_EN_RET on all three boards
   SESSION J_SMB pins      a JST-XH 1x7 at both ends: 1 to 4 unchanged, 5 DOCK_EN_RET, 6 the return (the ground between), 7 DOCK_EN_OUT at the row's end
   SESSION dock positions  J_DOCK and J_BLK pins 3 (DOCK_EN_RET) and 5 (DOCK_EN_OUT), pin 4 ground between them; pin 5's neighbours 4, 6 and 11 are all ground
   SESSION input bypass    C104 and C105, 2.2 uF 50 V X7R in series (1.1 uF) at the sense pair: TI SNVS452G section 10 ('a 1-uF ceramic capacitor to ground close to the drain of the hot swap MOSFET') and 11.1.1; in series as C11 and C12 are (board P's O-12)
   SESSION PGD             left open: IF-1's PGD option would need a conductor to board A, which is L4-E11's to decide
   SESSION test points     TP101 BRK_VIN, TP102 BRK_UVLO, TP103 DOCK_EN_OUT, TP104 DOCK_EN_RET, for E-12's commissioning steps
   SESSION lands           the VSSOP-10, SMC and 2512 lands the kit already uses for these parts; the 7-circuit XH header of the same row; RT1 on board P's 0402

